<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:8px">&nbsp;</p>

</section>

<section class="content">

<h3>Memory Verse</h3>

<div class="bible-passage">
<p>&laquo;You love all things that exist, and you hate none of the things you have made, for you would not have made anything if you had hated it.&raquo;</p>
<p class="bible-passage__ref">&mdash; Wisdom 11:24</p>
</div>

</section>

<section class="content">

<h3>Prayer for This Week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord, you who created the world out of nothing<br />
and sustain it with your love at every moment,<br />
open my eyes to see your imprint in everything around me.<br />
Help me to trust in your providence,<br />
even when I do not understand the path.<br />
May I know that I exist because you willed it,<br />
and that your love sustains my life in every moment.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

</section>

